            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tuca Araujo Ogle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "AMAZING!!!!! An \"eggless eggnogg\",\n if you please. No scalding, boiling nothing :) I had the coconut milk chilled. Put everything in the blender and it was ready to drink!",
            "datePublished": "2014-02-15T12:10:59.867Z"
