              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PerkyPop3171"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I followed the recipe exactly. This was way too thin. The taste was delicious. It tastes like the milk after eating a bowl of Cinnamon Toast Crunch. Maybe use coconut cream instead.",
            "datePublished": "2024-12-20T21:58:44.029Z"
