            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DizzySieve2574"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have to add that this recipe is absolutely delicious! I was looking for a similar flavor profile from a recipe I previously tried that I absolutely love and the person who makes it will absolutely not share their recipe because I will sell the heck out of it. 😂 This is similar but I think she may add half cream of coconut and half sweetened condensed milk. I am gonna keep trying until I find the right flavor. In the meantime, I will enjoy these two bottles this holiday. Thank you so much for sharing your gift!",
            "datePublished": "2024-12-24T20:14:55.655Z"
          },
